        "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox darktable\" cellspacing=\"3\" style=\"border-spacing:3px;width:22em;width:21.5em;\"><tbody><tr class=\"above-header\"><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:125%;font-weight:bold;padding:5px;\"><span style=\"display:table;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;\"><span style=\"display:table-row;\"><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:5px;width:1px;\"><span class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Faction\" title=\"Neutral\"><img alt=\"Neutral\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Neutral 32.png\" data-image-key=\"Neutral_32.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/1/19/Neutral_32.png/revision/latest?cb=20110620212507\" /></a></span></span></span><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:2px;\">Aderic</span></span></span></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/e/ed/AdericTomb.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180223212052\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Image of Aderic\"><img alt=\"Image of Aderic\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"178\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"AdericTomb.jpg\" data-image-key=\"AdericTomb.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/e/ed/AdericTomb.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20180223212052\" /></a></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Gender</th><td>\nMale</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Race</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Affiliation(s)</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_(kingdom)\" title=\"Gilneas (kingdom)\">Gilneas</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Occupation</th><td>\nPatriarch</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Location</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Aderic%27s_Repose\" title=\"Aderic&#39;s Repose\">Aderic's Repose</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_peninsula\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gilneas peninsula\">Gilneas</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Status</th><td>\nDeceased</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Aderic</b> was a <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">human</a> who was a <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_(kingdom)\" title=\"Gilneas (kingdom)\">Gilnean</a> patriarch. He is buried at <a href=\"/wiki/Aderic%27s_Repose\" title=\"Aderic&#39;s Repose\">Aderic's Repose</a> at the top of the hill. When the Gilneans retreated from <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_City\" title=\"Gilneas City\">Gilneas City</a> through the <a href=\"/wiki/Undertaker%27s_Pass\" title=\"Undertaker&#39;s Pass\">Undertaker's Pass</a> and into the Repose, they disturbed the graves of their ancestors, forcing their spirits to rise from their graves. <a href=\"/wiki/Krennan_Aranas\" title=\"Krennan Aranas\">Krennan Aranas</a> sought his blessing by offering and placing the <a href=\"/wiki/Blessed_Offerings\" title=\"Blessed Offerings\">Blessed Offerings</a> on his grave in hopes of calming the risen Gilnean spirits. He appears to have accepted the offer as the spirits returned to the grave.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Genn_Greymane\" title=\"Genn Greymane\">Genn</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Mia_Greymane\" title=\"Mia Greymane\">Mia Greymane</a> met at the \"Royal Aderic Banquet\".<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;font-size:calc(80% + 2.1px);\"><div style=\"margin-top:-0.3em; margin-bottom:0px; height:0px\">&#160;</div><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">^</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"nobreak\"><span class=\"questlong-prefix linkicon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"A\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/21/Alliance_15.png/revision/latest?cb=20110509070714\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Alliance 15.png\" data-image-key=\"Alliance_15.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span>&#160;<span class=\"linkicon raceicon\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/6/6e/IconSmall_Worgen_Male.gif/revision/latest?cb=20200520012351\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"IconSmall Worgen Male\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/6/6e/IconSmall_Worgen_Male.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/15?cb=20200520012351\" decod